Comments:       ----------
                Out-of-tree spl.ko.gz + zfs.ko.gz for Tiny Core
                CorePure64 kernel 6.18.35-tinycore64 (gzip/advdef -z4).
                tce-load runs depmod. Pulled automatically via
                zfs-modules-KERNEL.tcz from zfs.tcz.dep.
                ----------
                Load (usually via zfs.tcz):
                $ tce-load -i zfs-modules-6.18.35-tinycore64.tcz
                $ sudo modprobe zfs
                ----------
                Rebuild required when Tiny Core changes the running
                kernel ABI (new *-tinycore64 release).
                ----------
                This extension contains:
                openzfs-2.4.4 - CDDL-1.0 -
                https://github.com/openzfs/zfs/releases/tag/zfs-2.4.4
